SWEET FG F3 (patch 0158, docs/research/47 stage F3): the real battery in iOS on the Pixel 6. bsd/dev/sweet_fg_gs101.c gets sweet_fg_sample() (the F2 checks and transfers, quiet, mapped once, one user of the controller at a time; the ADT node is now parsed whenever it exists) and SweetBattery (xnu 0061) gets sweetbattery=2: every 30 s RepSOC (percent), VCell, AvgCurrent and Temp from the MAX77759 gauge, design capacity 4520 mAh, measured temperature. Charging = average current above 20 mA into the battery and external = charging or full (no charger register read yet). Until the first good sample the old static 100 % fallback is published. sweetbattery=0/1 are unchanged.

